---
import ServiceLayout from '../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import BendRule from '../components/BendRule.astro';
import { phone, business, terms } from '../config/site';
---

<ServiceLayout
  slug="custom-fabrication"
  title="Custom Off-Road Fabrication in Tucson | M1 Off-Road"
  description="Bumpers, mounts, brackets and repairs for off-road machines. Custom steel fabrication and MIG welding in Tucson by Mike Solger. Bring the machine and the idea."
  headline="The work that does not come in a box"
  lede="Bumpers, mounts, brackets, repairs, and the one-off that nobody makes a part for. If it is steel and it goes on an off-road machine, it is worth asking about."
  heroShot="svc-fab"
>
  <section class="bg-bone">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
      <BendRule class="mb-8 max-w-xs" />
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_minmax(0,24rem)] lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <h2 class="max-w-[20ch] text-[clamp(1.875rem,4.5vw,3rem)]">
            Bring the machine and the idea
          </h2>
          <div class="text-slate mt-6 max-w-[56ch] space-y-4 text-lg">
            <p>
              Cages, doors and roofs are the bulk of the work, but they are not
              the whole of it. A bumper that has to clear a winch. A mount for
              something the machine was never designed to carry. A bracket that
              broke on a rock and needs to come back stronger than it left.
            </p>
            <p>
              Custom work is easier to talk through than to describe on a page.
              A photo and a sentence about what you want it to do is usually
              enough to know whether it is a job.
            </p>
            <p class="text-shop">
              If it cannot be done here, you will be told that on the phone
              rather than after the machine is already apart.
            </p>
          </div>

          <dl class="border-bone-line mt-10 grid gap-px border-t">
            <div class="border-bone-line grid gap-1 border-b py-4 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr]">
              <dt class="font-semibold">Welding</dt>
              <dd class="text-slate">
                MIG. {business.yearsInBusiness.replace(/^over /, 'Over ')} of it.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="border-bone-line grid gap-1 border-b py-4 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr]">
              <dt class="font-semibold">Finish</dt>
              <dd class="text-slate">Powder coating is sent out to a coater.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="border-bone-line grid gap-1 border-b py-4 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr]">
              <dt class="font-semibold">Price</dt>
              <dd class="text-slate">
                {terms.servicePricing}. One-offs have to be — nobody can price
                a part they have not seen.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="border-bone-line grid gap-1 border-b py-4 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr]">
              <dt class="font-semibold">Time in the shop</dt>
              <dd class="text-slate">{terms.leadTime}.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <p class="mt-8 text-lg">
            <a
              href={phone.sms}
              data-analytics="text-fab-inline"
              class="text-shop font-semibold underline decoration-1 underline-offset-4"
              >Text a photo to {phone.display}</a
            >
            <span class="text-slate"> — that is usually the fastest way.</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <Placeholder shot="bend-bare" light class="w-full" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServiceLayout>
